{"seq":2,"slug":"etl-pipeline","title":"ETL 流水线：数据抽取/转换/加载、调度系统、增量处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-warehouse-basics/etl-pipeline","wordCount":1299,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"etl-流水线-数据抽取-转换-加载-调度系统-增量处理\">ETL 流水线：数据抽取/转换/加载、调度系统、增量处理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ETL vs ELT</strong>：ETL 在中间层转换，ELT 加载到目标后就地转换，后者在云数仓场景下越来越流行</li>\n<li><strong>数据抽取</strong>：全量抽取、时间戳增量、自增 ID 增量、CDC（日志/触发器）四种方式，优先级递减</li>\n<li><strong>CDC（变更数据捕获）</strong>：基于 Binlog/WAL 解析的日志 CDC 最完整及时，是核心业务表抽取的首选</li>\n<li><strong>数据转换</strong>：涵盖清洗、标准化、关联、聚合、派生与脱敏，DWD 层是最重要的转换环节</li>\n<li><strong>调度系统</strong>：通过 DAG 管理任务依赖，幂等性与分区隔离是调度设计的核心原则</li>\n<li><strong>增量处理策略</strong>：全量覆盖、分区追加、增量合并、拉链表，选择取决于数据特性和分析需求</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"etl-概述\">ETL 概述</h2><p>ETL（Extract-Transform-Load）是数据仓库建设中最核心的工程环节，负责将数据从源系统抽取出来，经过清洗和转换后加载到目标数据仓库中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[数据源] --&gt;|Extract| B[暂存区]&#10;    B --&gt;|Transform| C[转换处理]&#10;    C --&gt;|Load| D[数据仓库]\">graph LR\n    A[数据源] --&gt;|Extract| B[暂存区]\n    B --&gt;|Transform| C[转换处理]\n    C --&gt;|Load| D[数据仓库]</pre><h3 id=\"etl-vs-elt\">ETL vs ELT</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>ETL</th>\n<th>ELT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>转换位置</td>\n<td>在中间层完成转换</td>\n<td>加载到目标后在目标中转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算资源</td>\n<td>依赖 ETL 工具的计算能力</td>\n<td>利用目标数据库的计算能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>传统数据仓库</td>\n<td>云数据仓库/数据湖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>转换逻辑固定在管道中</td>\n<td>原始数据保留，可灵活重算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据新鲜度</td>\n<td>延迟较高</td>\n<td>延迟较低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表工具</td>\n<td>Informatica/DataStage</td>\n<td>dbt/Spark SQL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据抽取-extract\">数据抽取（Extract）</h2><h3 id=\"抽取方式\">抽取方式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[数据抽取方式] --&gt; B[全量抽取]&#10;    A --&gt; C[增量抽取]&#10;    A --&gt; D[CDC 变更数据捕获]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[每次抽取全部数据]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[只抽取变化的数据]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[基于日志捕获变更]\">graph TD\n    A[数据抽取方式] --&gt; B[全量抽取]\n    A --&gt; C[增量抽取]\n    A --&gt; D[CDC 变更数据捕获]\n    B --&gt; B1[每次抽取全部数据]\n    C --&gt; C1[只抽取变化的数据]\n    D --&gt; D1[基于日志捕获变更]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抽取方式</th>\n<th>实现原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量抽取</td>\n<td>SELECT * FROM table</td>\n<td>实现简单</td>\n<td>数据量大时效率低</td>\n<td>小表、维度表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间戳增量</td>\n<td>WHERE updated_at &gt; ?</td>\n<td>效率高</td>\n<td>依赖时间戳字段</td>\n<td>有更新时间的表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自增 ID 增量</td>\n<td>WHERE id &gt; ?</td>\n<td>简单高效</td>\n<td>只能捕获新增</td>\n<td>只追加的表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志 CDC</td>\n<td>解析 Binlog/WAL</td>\n<td>最完整、最及时</td>\n<td>实现复杂</td>\n<td>核心业务表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发器 CDC</td>\n<td>数据库触发器记录变更</td>\n<td>准确</td>\n<td>影响源系统性能</td>\n<td>不推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"cdc-实现\">CDC 实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 基于时间戳的增量抽取&#10;SELECT *&#10;FROM source_orders&#10;WHERE updated_at &gt; &#39;2025-03-14 00:00:00&#39;&#10;  AND updated_at &lt;= &#39;2025-03-15 00:00:00&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 基于自增 ID 的增量抽取&#10;SELECT *&#10;FROM source_events&#10;WHERE id &gt; (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(source_id), 0) FROM ods_events)&#10;LIMIT 100000;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 基于时间戳的增量抽取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2025-03-14 00:00:00'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2025-03-15 00:00:00'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 基于自增 ID 的增量抽取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(source_id), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ods_events)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- CDC 数据的合并处理（Merge/Upsert）&#10;MERGE INTO dwd_orders AS target&#10;USING (&#10;    SELECT * FROM ods_orders_cdc&#10;    WHERE dt = CURRENT_DATE&#10;) AS source&#10;ON target.order_id = source.order_id&#10;WHEN MATCHED THEN&#10;    UPDATE SET&#10;        status = source.status,&#10;        amount = source.amount,&#10;        updated_at = source.updated_at&#10;WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN&#10;    INSERT (order_id, user_id, status, amount, created_at, updated_at)&#10;    VALUES (source.order_id, source.user_id, source.status, source.amount, source.created_at, source.updated_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- CDC 数据的合并处理（Merge/Upsert）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MERGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dwd_orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> target</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ods_orders_cdc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> MATCHED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">updated_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> MATCHED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    INSERT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, amount, created_at, updated_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">updated_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据转换-transform\">数据转换（Transform）</h2><h3 id=\"转换类型\">转换类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>转换类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>SQL 示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据清洗</td>\n<td>去重、空值处理、格式修正</td>\n<td>DISTINCT、COALESCE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据标准化</td>\n<td>统一编码、统一枚举值</td>\n<td>CASE WHEN 映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据关联</td>\n<td>多表关联，维度扩展</td>\n<td>JOIN 维度表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据聚合</td>\n<td>按维度汇总</td>\n<td>GROUP BY + SUM/COUNT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据派生</td>\n<td>基于现有字段计算新字段</td>\n<td>数学运算、时间函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据脱敏</td>\n<td>敏感字段处理</td>\n<td>HASH、掩码函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 典型的 DWD 层转换 SQL&#10;INSERT INTO dwd_trade_order_detail&#10;SELECT&#10;    NEXTVAL(&#39;order_key_seq&#39;) AS order_key,&#10;    o.order_id,&#10;    COALESCE(u.user_key, -1) AS user_key,&#10;    COALESCE(p.product_key, -1) AS product_key,&#10;    CAST(TO_CHAR(o.created_at, &#39;YYYYMMDD&#39;) AS INT) AS date_key,&#10;    o.amount AS order_amount,&#10;    COALESCE(o.discount, 0) AS discount_amount,&#10;    o.amount - COALESCE(o.discount, 0) AS actual_amount,&#10;    CASE o.status&#10;        WHEN 0 THEN &#39;pending&#39;&#10;        WHEN 1 THEN &#39;paid&#39;&#10;        WHEN 2 THEN &#39;shipped&#39;&#10;        WHEN 3 THEN &#39;completed&#39;&#10;        WHEN -1 THEN &#39;cancelled&#39;&#10;        ELSE &#39;unknown&#39;&#10;    END AS order_status,&#10;    COALESCE(o.payment_method, &#39;unknown&#39;) AS payment_method,&#10;    COALESCE(o.source, &#39;unknown&#39;) AS order_source,&#10;    o.created_at,&#10;    CURRENT_DATE AS dt&#10;FROM ods_orders o&#10;LEFT JOIN dim_user u ON o.user_id = u.user_id AND u.is_current = TRUE&#10;LEFT JOIN dim_product p ON o.product_id = p.product_id AND p.is_current = TRUE&#10;WHERE o.dt = CURRENT_DATE;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 典型的 DWD 层转换 SQL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dwd_trade_order_detail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    NEXTVAL(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_key_seq'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E